{"id":761,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><div><p>为弘扬雷锋精神，充分发挥党员先锋模范作用，2月28日中午，体育学院研究生党支部、本科生党支部组织开展了“党员先锋行，洁净暖人心”学习雷锋精神主题党日活动，对学院办公楼进行了全面清洁打扫。</p><p>活动中，同学们热情高涨，分工明确，手持扫帚、抹布等工具，认真清扫办公楼内的每一处角落。他们仔细擦拭门窗桌椅，清理地面垃圾，并对实验室的仪器设备进行了整理和清洁。经过大家的共同努力，办公楼环境焕然一新，为师生营造了更加整洁舒适的工作学习环境。</p><p>此次活动不仅改善了体育学院院楼的环境卫生状况，更让同学们在实践中深刻体会了雷锋精神的内涵，增强了党支部的凝聚力和战斗力。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NLmATkLRCsM4CsLt7QVLz-aLRWRL8LjPUmvZnzT2LNlDL8-0gihFp2hmCIa0M1ysMSy4oSyZnmT7nzvbUzA2nlnfUlLZLz9iLmUbU4MfMRTFU4V7M4WVMzrFLl7DMz-Jqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg474L4LZgtA8pUwcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1046&nid=13338&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/675398F9DE79A8FEDAAC8185249C3A49/C1D72E55/1A652\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NL4CT8LRUPUznRntzLPnRGsMl7aMzvjsUlVkLNVVM49sU4G0gihFp2hmCIa0n1ysLShfn1y4oz6Ro7rkU4GPU8n7nRVRLzTRLNVVnzMfUmTFoRVVMl-DM4nFL4lPM7r7gtXaQ4Oeo4x8_5AbgDTJQty0LzG8M1yPL4L4okbw62w8c&oid=1054562613&tid=1046&nid=13338&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NU4LTbM7LanmTkUtlVVMzNPL7W2MNCjiUmv8nzTRLmQko770gihFp2hmCIa0L1yiU1h7L1yinR74oRlZMR7PU474L77anRv4M8MVMzr2LlVFoRVRo7-PM7MFLzlZMRlJqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg474L4LZgtA8pUwcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1046&nid=13338&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/25BD25D13858411C130A0D737CE55F1A/81C8B14C/15845\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NnmGTaU8LbnmA2otzTRnmfkMmN4U4-jin7CYMRlPMmv4nRv0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyDUSyaU1hVMR9inNU4L7r2nRffU4UYUzTkLRNsnlMRLmfFUzU8L4QfLR6FLNnRMRlbgtXaQ4Oeo4x8_5AbgDTJQty0LzG8M1yPL4L4okbw62w8c&oid=1054562613&tid=1046&nid=13338&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=NLlCTDUzWVU47ZMt4WVMlrkUzLPMzCjZoz67LRUiLmUZLR70gihFp2hmCIa0nkyZMYy8M1yinlCbLmfkMzUPU4lPM7lPnNUDLm7ZU8lYM7VFnzM7UzAknNVFnlU4M1b/v2veo4Oe6dTZ_ShXptQ0g47aMRC0LzL4L49Jqdwnx&oid=1054562613&tid=1046&nid=13338&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D87465EF920B541C514E1FD6218CE24A/E3DA8BFA/ED36\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_at